{"id":"pojdyomte","lemma":"пойдёмте","pos":"verb","rank":1885,"glosses":["come on","let's go"],"examples":[{"text":"Вы двое пойдёмте со мной.","en":"You two come with me.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"two , two of them"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"I","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Если можете, пойдёмте с нами.","en":"If you can, come with us.","words":[{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"we","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Пойдёмте есть вместе.","en":"Let's go to eat together.","words":[null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"together"}]},{"text":"Пойдёмте со мной. Я покажу вам дорогу.","en":"Come with me. I'll show you the way.","words":[null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"I","l":"я"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to show","l":"показать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null]},{"text":"Пойдёмте в вашу комнату.","en":"Let's go to your room.","words":[null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]}]}